<title>ESTONIA: SAKU TO PAY ONE KROON PER SHARE DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>SAKU TO PAY ONE KROON PER SHARE DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saku brewery said on Tuesday that their share holders meeting decided the company will pay a dividend of one kroon per share or eight million kroons and 6.5 million kroons will be paid into the company's reserve capital.</p>
<p>Saku, listed on the free market of stock exchange, also said the shareholders approved the company's financial statement with a profit of 27.3 million kroon for 1996.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuter.ee</p>
</text>
